WEBVTT

00:25.722 --> 00:32.568
They saw a chair, they saw a scream A white, white

00:32.688 --> 00:34.570
boy silencing

00:37.615 --> 00:42.379
They didn't see the brilliant light that burned

00:42.539 --> 00:47.043
inside, so pure and bright.

00:49.786 --> 00:53.829
They didn't hear your wicked wits or how the

00:53.970 --> 00:58.173
puzzle pieces fit. They saw the shell, I saw the

00:58.353 --> 01:03.678
pearl, the gun against a noisy world.

01:04.919 --> 01:09.720
I don't see the boy they see I only see the best of

01:09.760 --> 01:15.261
me Reflected in your knowing eyes Beneath the

01:15.301 --> 01:18.702
clear and open skies I'll be your voice, I'll be

01:18.722 --> 01:22.423
your shield A fortress that will never yield

01:22.523 --> 01:27.364
They'll never know, they'll never find The

01:27.464 --> 01:33.585
brilliant, beautiful boy inside

01:37.087 --> 01:40.850
And when I'm with you in the night Beneath the

01:40.950 --> 01:45.293
soft and fading light They see a line they think

01:45.373 --> 01:46.673
we've crossed

01:49.355 --> 01:53.077
A treasure gained, a virtue lost But they don't

01:53.137 --> 01:56.980
know this sacred space This perfect time, this

01:57.120 --> 02:00.082
perfect place

02:00.924 --> 02:01.984
Reflected

02:32.492 --> 02:38.656
The brilliant, beautiful boy inside.

02:39.837 --> 02:40.957
Hey! Hey!

02:47.601 --> 02:47.741
Hey!

03:01.707 --> 03:01.747
Oh

